            "review_title": "Review at Công Chúa Bánh Mì",
            "review_text": "Go10894519236\n13 contributions\n0\nExperience Authentic Saigon Banh Mi at Cong Chau Banh Mi\nSep 2026 • Friends\nTraditional Saigon-style cold meat baguette with a crispy hot crust, rich pate blended with fragrant butter. Add some sour pickles and cucumber to balance the richness.\n\nThe bread bowl is served piping hot and fragrant. Runny egg sunny-side up with creamy pate and rich sauce, tearing pieces of bread to dip is extremely addictive.\n\nChicken baguette is easy to eat with tender, juicy shredded chicken, not dry at all. The seasoned sauce is perfectly balanced and permeates every strand of chicken, combined with the aromatic herbs, making it very flavorful.\n\nThe restaurant space is clean, and the staff are quick and friendly even with continuous customer traffic. Recommended for both tourists and locals to enjoy!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten September 14, 2026",
